OL,5,G1100 Destroyer
OL,6,     F(1943) There was an old boat - a
OL,7,     Fpost office that floats - that got
OL,8,     Fdragged into the war. When it was
OL,9,     Ftorpedoed, in the seawater flowed.
OL,10,     FCan it deliver the mail any more?
OL,11,     F#NationalPoetryDay
OL,12,G1305 They Rode West
OL,13,     F(1954) A surgeon on the wild
OL,14,     Ffrontier, must save the Kiowa
OL,15,     Fnation, by curing their malaria on
OL,16,     Fa high-plains reservation.
OL,17,     F#NationalPoetryDay
OL,23,VppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppG1/4
