OL,5,G1445 Garden of Evil
OL,6,     F(1954) In a derelict gold mining
OL,7,     Ftown, poor John Fuller is trapped
OL,8,     Funderground. The Apache are near,
OL,9,     Fso the danger is clear. For three
OL,10,     Fdrifters, the only way's down.
OL,11,     F#NationalPoetryDay
OL,12,G1650 Anastasia
OL,13,     F(1956) Ingrid Bergman's ingenue is
OL,14,     Fchosen by Yul Brynner, to hoax the
OL,15,     FRussian royal court - but has he
OL,16,     Fpicked a winner?
OL,17,     F#NationalPoetryDay
